{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Drifters Don't Brake: Midnight Demo\u00a0</strong>is a Top-down Arcade Racer where the car is always accelerating and you must navigate through different terrains by <i>drifting</i>. How many attempts will you need in order to beat all the challenging levels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a Demo version, which means it will contain limited content to show only the core game mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/35ae58c2eff6439e8274d1906451bae3.poster.avif?t=1752354872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/35ae58c2eff6439e8274d1906451bae3.webm?t=1752354872\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/35ae58c2eff6439e8274d1906451bae3.mp4?t=1752354872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No Brakes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is no brake mechanic in the game, you'll have to think fast and drift your way through the levels. Any mistake might ruin your run.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each stage includes at least one game mode. A game mode is a modifier that alters the stage\u2019s objectives, rules, and/or core mechanics.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Varied Terrains</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will need to adapt your drifting techniques to drive over different terrains. The terrains can cause the car to drift more or less, as well as interfere on the car speed or controls. </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/39613ae16221349aacafb9588a2413f5.poster.avif?t=1752354872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/39613ae16221349aacafb9588a2413f5.webm?t=1752354872\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/39613ae16221349aacafb9588a2413f5.mp4?t=1752354872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Car Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Change the car color, window color, decals, and decals colors to create a more personalized design. </p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/21ef49c929c8227dcae4eb13acbb1eee.poster.avif?t=1752354872\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/21ef49c929c8227dcae4eb13acbb1eee.webm?t=1752354872\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/extras/21ef49c929c8227dcae4eb13acbb1eee.mp4?t=1752354872\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3836600?t=1752354872","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3836600/70d06c0a7a0754138821de3aa287c60fc301812f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752354872","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/383660